"Set [`social.inIndigenousLand`](project-"
"schema.json,/definitions/Social,inIndigenousLand) to `true`."
msgstr ""
"Configure [`social.inIndigenousLand`](project-"
"schema.json,/definitions/Social,inIndigenousLand) a `verdadero`."

