"[`locations`](project-schema.json,,locations) array, set its "
"[`.id`](project-schema.json,/definitions/Location,id) incrementally and set "
"its description to \"Indigenous land: <Name> (<Category>)\" substituting "
"<Name> and <Category> for the name and land category from the Landmark "
